//
// Stained glass / ステンドグラス
// Pack: artstyle (Art styles for image generation) · element 08 · Category: Painting & printmaking
// What happens: The same line drawing becomes a glass picture divided by black lead lines; sky, hill, house and tree each turn into pieces of colored glass with light shining through.
// Motion spec:
//   - Material: pieces of colored glass joined by lead, as in a window
//   - Look: areas of color divided by thick black lines, glowing as light passes through
//   - Sample: the same base sketch (a line drawing of a house, a tree and the sun on a hill) was given to an image model as a reference and redrawn in this style. A diagonal wipe turns the sketch into the style from 0.5 s to 1.35 s, the picture slowly zooms to 1.045x until 4.0 s, and it fades back to the sketch from 4.0 s to 4.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s, cubic ease-in-out) (this sample is cropped slightly wider so the lead lines of the hill show)
// When to use it: For a solemn or festive decorative look that glows with light.
// Tags: stained glass, glass, lead lines, mosaic, window, glowing
// Size: 539x208 px · Cycle: 4.7 s
// Needs: kit artstyle -> https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/api/v1/kit/artstyle.js
// Live demo: https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/#200
//
// cells[i](k, w, h, u): k = CanvasRenderingContext2D (already cleared and wrapped in save/restore by the caller), w,h = size, u = seconds in [0, cycle). The picture depends only on u.
// Element code starts here. CELLS, constants and helpers live in the kit.

// @element 08
// ステンドグラス: 黒い枠で区切った光る色ガラス（丘の鉛の枠まで写すため、切り出し位置が違う下絵を使う）
CELLS[7] = (k, w, h, u) => gafu(k, w, h, u, '08');
